{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28015","headline":"题钱宇别墅 · 朱庆余","name":"题钱宇别墅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"林居向晚饶清景，惜去非关恋酒桮。\n石净每因杉露滴，地幽渐觉水禽来。\n药蔬秋後供僧尽，竹杖吟中望月回。\n红叶闲飘篱落迥，行人远见草堂开。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱庆余","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28015.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28015","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}